sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Runtime as Caikit Runtime<br/>8080/TCP HTTP<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant LocalMod as caikit-nlp Module<br/>(in-process)
    participant PyTorch as PyTorch / Transformers<br/>(in-process)
    participant TGISMod as caikit-nlp TGIS Module<br/>(in-process)
    participant TGIS as TGIS Server<br/>gRPC (Configurable TLS)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 1: Local Model Inference (Embedding / Local Text Gen)
    Client->>Runtime: POST /api/v1/task/embedding<br/>HTTP :8080 (Configurable TLS)
    Runtime->>LocalMod: Route to EmbeddingModule<br/>(function call)
    LocalMod->>PyTorch: sentence-transformers encode<br/>(function call)
    PyTorch-->>LocalMod: Embedding vectors
    LocalMod-->>Runtime: EmbeddingResult
    Runtime-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 2: Remote TGIS Inference (Text Generation)
    Client->>Runtime: gRPC TextGenerationTask<br/>gRPC :8085 (Configurable TLS)
    Runtime->>TGISMod: Route to PeftPromptTuningTGIS<br/>(function call)
    TGISMod->>TGIS: GenerationRequest<br/>gRPC (ca_cert, client_cert TLS)
    TGIS-->>TGISMod: GenerationResponse
    TGISMod-->>Runtime: TextGenerationResult
    Runtime-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over Client,FS: Flow 3: Model Training (Prompt Tuning)
    Client->>Runtime: Train request<br/>HTTP :8080 or gRPC :8085
    Runtime->>LocalMod: Route to PeftPromptTuning.train<br/>(function call)
    LocalMod->>PyTorch: PEFT prompt tuning loop<br/>(function call)
    PyTorch-->>LocalMod: Trained prompt vectors
    LocalMod->>FS: Save model artifacts<br/>(file I/O)
    LocalMod-->>Runtime: Training result
    Runtime-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,HFHub: Flow 4: Model Download (Optional)
    Client->>Runtime: Load model request
    Runtime->>LocalMod: Module.load()
    LocalMod->>HFHub: Download model<br/>HTTPS :443 (when ALLOW_DOWNLOADS=1)
    HFHub-->>LocalMod: Model artifacts
    LocalMod-->>Runtime: Model loaded
